    "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1#S4.E6",
    "original_text": "ASTIS-authored sufficient noncompact C2 Gaussian background independently sealed before proof.\nFor every finite-dimensional complete real Hilbert/Borel space E, including rank zero, let gamma be literal stdGaussian E. Every signed real globally C2 f with actual f in L2(gamma), true gradient f in L2(gamma), and Phi(f²) integrable satisfies homogeneous Ent_gamma(f²)<=2 integral norm(gradient f)^2. The actual cutoff mass, entropy and gradient-energy limits are proved internally. Phi(t)=t log t is continuous at zero; neither positive mass nor normalization nor compact support is assumed.\nExact scope: Actual stdGaussian E on finite-dimensional real Hilbert/Borel E, signed globally C2 f with real fL2/gradientL2/Phi(f²)L1 domains. These are produced by actual32 for its true sqrt-density. No cutoff limit/desired inequality/domain-of-repaired-density/law/energy certificate premises. Genuine noncompact function-LSI coefficient2 through internally derived actual cutoff limits; rank0/zero mass retained. Coherent33 KL/Fisher, full weak W12 extension, separate GaussianT2/FIRST4.6/both paper main/error/cost/composition/fullreader remain OPEN.\ntheorem gaussian_logSobolev_of_contDiff\n    {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n    [CompleteSpace E] [FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n    [MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E]\n    (f : E → ℝ) (hf : ContDiff ℝ 2 f)\n    (hf2 : MemLp f 2 (ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E))\n    (hgrad2 : MemLp (gradient f) 2 (ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E))\n    (hentropy : Integrable (fun x => (f x)^2 * Real.log ((f x)^2))\n      (ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E)) :\n    let γ : Measure E := ProbabilityTheory.stdGaussian E\n    (∫ x, (f x)^2 * Real.log ((f x)^2) ∂γ) -\n      (∫ x, (f x)^2 ∂γ) * Real.log (∫ x, (f x)^2 ∂γ) ≤\n      2 * ∫ x, ‖gradient f x‖^2 ∂γ\n\nIndependent source contract:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"creator\": \"gaussian_noncompact_preread_42\",\n  \"status\": \"SOURCE_GRAPH_AUTHOR_NOT_SELFVALIDATED\",\n  \"exact691signature_sha256\": \"ff9add5e7b7ce9ec01b1719574b8e80b843d3a469dd3026c6e40b831dab0a6ca\",\n  \"source_first_exposure\": [\n    \"AGENTS and source-dependency/semantic-roundtrip/SLT skills\",\n    \"MEMORY.md search lines552-586; historical guidance only, current source/API conclusions independently checked\",\n    \"execution and first80 lines companion handoff\",\n    \"broad filename discovery including current41 artifact names\",\n    \"Accidental rg snippets from current41 decoder-binding original_text and source/reviewer metadata including original source contract; no intentionally opened body/Test/lesson/anonymous decoder packet; may include intended contract text.\",\n    \"Accidental shared32 lines236-249 early proof body due oversized public excerpt; recorded, not used for contract inference.\",\n    \"primary liveweb and pinned local HTML\",\n    \"exact41 prospective640 signature only\",\n    \"actual32/33 public signatures, canonical Cutoff/Gradient definitions/APIs\",\n    \"pinned SLT background source selected regions, source-only arithmetic/derivative routes\",\n    \"pinned Mathlib API source selected regions; no compiler\"\n  ],\n  \"primary\": \"2609.06906v1 S4.E6/S4.SS1.p4.3\",\n  \"source_before_candidate_preread_sha256\": \"542175d3ae299c57b9c7c06490190e894b76448842d7e4292e47eb5bb5ecbcc7\",\n  \"statement_seal_sha256\": \"35a0ed0f2f0cb99ea1ac12441d511a781ec80aea82c16a774a68aa68a1f41088\",\n  \"objects\": \"actual finite realHilbert stdGaussian law, signed C2 f, actual global gradient\",\n  \"domains\": \"C2/fL2/truegradientL2/PhiL1 are true background domains supplied by actual32; not new paper assumptions\",\n  \"internal_obligations\": \"cutoff regularity, measurability, zeroaware entropy domination, true gradient calculus and actual mass/Phi/energy limits are dependency edges, not binders\",\n  \"constants\": \"exact2; no dimension bound; internal C/R with C chosen before R; future same32/33energy factor1/4 yields futureKL factor1/2\",\n  \"endpoints\": \"rank0 signed f f=0 chi=0 zero mass included; no massdivision/logdifferentiation\",\n  \"attribution\": \"authored sufficient C2 source route for omitted primary GaussianLSI; distinct from upstream W12/tower/mollification/Fatou source and printed FIRST\",\n  \"alternatives\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OR42:direct-C2-cutoff\",\n      \"logic\": \"AND\",\n      \"parents\": [\n        \"route42:R01\",\n        \"route42:R02\",\n        \"route42:R18\"\n      ],\n      \"conclusion\": \"target:GaussianLogSobolev42\",\n      \"source_use_site\": {\n        \"source\": \"authored-source-route\",\n        \"line_start\": 21,\n        \"line_end\": 21\n      },\n      \"obligation_status\": \"chosen sufficient route, all SOURCE_GAPs must be internally proved; no proof credit\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"OR42:external-W12-mollification\",\n      \"logic\": \"AND\",\n      \"parents\": [\n        \"route42:R20\",\n        \"route42:R21\"\n      ],\n      \"conclusion\": \"target:GaussianLogSobolev42\",\n      \"source_use_site\": {\n        \"source\": \"authored-source-route\",\n        \"line_start\": 21,\n        \"line_end\": 23\n      },\n      \"obligation_status\": \"alternative external-reference path, unresolved carrier/Sobolev adapter and imported/unexpanded providers; not callable local truth\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"API_identifier_boundary\": \"All asserted identities have pinned source declaration locators and lexical namespace checks. Ambiguous methods/aliases/generated names remain exact source-token externalunexpanded, not asserted elaborated QNames.\",\n  \"theorem_approval\": false,\n  \"topology_selfvalidation\": false,\n  \"compiler_run\": false,\n  \"proof_search\": false,\n  \"current_policy_delta\": \"policy-chronology.json; old exactprefix preserved; current append is administrative not mathematics\"\n}\n",
