    "evidence": "Independent comparison to primary-before-body contract f872a588, pinned SPHMCv1 ec485cdad5fe140114be35eef93d19398e0cafcf21abb3fff1bdbbf462e5f94d S4.E6/S4.SS1.p4.3 and admitted source-only topology. Entire production (all five private helpers), all three actual Tests, and seven authored formula steps read. Direct API/provenance and exact publication/decoder bindings independently re-created; 177 raw/LF frozen inputs plus primary inputs match. Root representation/count corrections retained as historical metadata-only evidence. No whole-math verdict used, no compiler run, no canonical write.",
